    [Doc][Misc] Remove redundant dynamic chunked pipeline parallel tutorial (#19644)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    The CPP user guide already covers deployment, tuning, online
    calibration, and performance. The separate DeepSeek-V3.1 tutorial
    duplicates that guidance and uses a model whose vLLM Ascend support
    ended in v0.30.0.
    
    - Delete the redundant tutorial and its Chinese translation.
    - Remove its navigation entry from `mkdocs.yml` and title mapping from
    `docs/hooks/nav_titles.py`.
    - Remove links to the deleted tutorial from the CPP user guide and
    design document, including their Chinese translations.
    
    CPP remains supported. Its user guide and design document are retained.
    
    Release-branch counterpart: #19645.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No runtime behavior changes. Documentation-only cleanup; no release note
    fragment is needed.
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    - English and Chinese strict documentation builds passed:
      ```bash
      DOCS_LANG=en SITE_DIR=../build-main-en bash tools/rtd_build.sh
      DOCS_LANG=zh SITE_DIR=../build-main-zh bash tools/rtd_build.sh
      ```
    - Changed-file pre-commit hooks passed: `ruff-check`, `ruff-format`,
    `markdownlint`, `codespell`, and `typos`.
    - Parsed the edited PO files with duplicate detection and verified their
    entries match both the English sources and generated Chinese output.
    - Checked that no source or generated HTML links reference the removed
    tutorial, and that the CPP guide/design pages remain in both builds.
    - `git diff --check` passed.
    
    Full `bash format.sh ci` was attempted but did not complete: actionlint
    environment initialization stalled on the Go toolchain download. A
    separate Python network probe of the download endpoint failed with
    `RemoteDisconnected: Remote end closed connection without response`; the
    waiting check was stopped. Full lint remains for CI. No runtime tests
    were added because this change only removes documentation and its
    references.
    
    ### Checklist
    
    The runtime boundary, regression, failure-path, and performance test
    items are not applicable to this documentation-only change.
    - vLLM main:
    https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/commit/c0b6f74bee518aeaf5d72b200a0216e72fbb5e7c
    
